  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Thank you for adding ability to choosing invite+, friends, and friends+ instance as home world.\nIn addition, I want VRChat to have ability to choose region of home world.\nCurrently/Recently JP region has/had problems on loading worlds.\nHowever, at the launch time, It looks home world is launched to nearest region.\n(Even if the default region of new instance is USW, the home isntance is JP.)\nAs a workaround of such a problem, I want ability to choose region of home world.",
